  <item>
    <title>Vol.011 作为半个福建人，歌单里有哪些闽南语歌曲？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676ebff315a5fd520e1dea57</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676ebff315a5fd520e1dea57</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Dec 2024 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>SCOOPS！又来更新了！这期是看了Hopico的HMA颁奖发现里面有台湾歌手FunkyMo的歌曲，这一下子就把我的闽南语歌曲的魂勾起来了！作为半个福建人从小时候听歌就是陈小云、陈雷、叶启田……相信有很多90后福建的朋友跟我有一样的感受，现在好像已经不经常听到闽南语歌曲了，之前还有茄子蛋、椅子乐团一些新的台湾歌手出现，椅子乐团，在我第一次看《乐队的夏天》就记住了，非常非常好听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>那这期SCOOPS就让我们一起来听听看，我作为半个福建人，我的歌单里都有哪些新的闽南语歌曲呢？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「听歌目录」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="228">03:48</a> Maybe Maybe - 椅子乐团The Chairs</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a> Tic Tac - 川秋沙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> Big Old Tree - 小安</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a> 相忘 - 邰智源 &amp; 卢广仲Crowd Lu</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1465">24:25</a> 望春风 - 陶喆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1643">27:23</a>萬千花蕊慈母悲哀 - 珂拉琪Collage</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1879">31:19</a> 同款 - 洪佩瑜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2166">36:06</a> 你啊你啊 - 魏如萱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2492">41:32</a> 梦中见 - Refine,the concert Live - 安溥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2842">47:22</a> 芭樂 - FunkyMo</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3049">50:49</a> 蒼南夜語 - Gatsby in a Daze暈蓋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3367">56:07</a> 最好的距離 - 鄭宜農Enno Cheng &amp; Deca Joins</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>*歌曲版权归创作者所有</span></em></p>]]></description>
