    <guid isPermaLink="false">648c7eb4eedbb7b5edddad2d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Jun 2023 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>NBA总决赛落下帷幕，但NBA的场外新闻可从未消失，对于NBA的运动员来说，签约哪个品牌无疑是一件大事，那在前段时间NBA球员德鲁大叔Kyrie Irving要签约国产运动品牌安踏的事件闹的沸沸扬扬，当然在最近我们也看在社交媒体上看到Kyrie Irving频繁上脚安踏的鞋款、服饰。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>而让我们追溯到是谁第一时间爆出安踏要签约Kyrie Irving？竟然是一家媒体？而他们也因为这次爆料流量飙升。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>安踏签约Kyrie Irving还不是一个定数，具体还是得以官方消息为准。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>「本期声音」</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ricky&amp;Banned&amp;Kuma</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7564338809" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7564338809"><span>Ricky</span></a><span>&amp;</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3282820825?topnav=1&amp;wvr=6&amp;topsug=1" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3282820825?topnav=1&amp;wvr=6&amp;topsug=1"><span>Kuma</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b61a352f7e8b9404aa405b0?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=61df7eab00000000020231aa&amp;apptime=1686928703" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b61a352f7e8b9404aa405b0?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=61df7eab00000000020231aa&amp;apptime=1686928703"><span>Ricky</span></a><span>&amp;</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c0948c56b58b75e38c9b883?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=61df7eab00000000020231aa&amp;apptime=1686929014" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c0948c56b58b75e38c9b883?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=61df7eab00000000020231aa&amp;apptime=1686929014"><span>Kuma</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>「创作团队」</span></p><span></span><p><span>kuma&amp;shufjan</span></p><span></span><p><span>「关注&amp;联系」</span></p><span></span><p><span>bilibili：SCOOPS辛闻</span></p>]]></description>
