  <item>
    <title>Vol.007 定价是ARC&apos;TERYX的两倍？Goldwin 0凭什么卖这么贵？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63b64326289d2739647d94a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63b64326289d2739647d94a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Jan 2023 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家2023年快乐，终于送走了悲催的2022迎来新的2023，不知道各位的心情是怎么样的呢？本期播客我们就来聊了聊已经火了几个时段的Gorpcore风潮，而在这个风潮下也催生出了很多新的设计师例如Jean Luc Ambridge，其作为Goldwin 0系列的设计师，给整个Goldwin 0系列产品带来了新风尚的Gorpcore风格。同时，Goldwin 0也在用一种全新的方式去展现Goldwin的品牌力，将艺术、科学、自然，三轴理念灌输到Goldwin 0的产品当中，无论是使用创新性的面料</span><strong><span>「Brewed Protein™」</span></strong><span>，还是产品在互联网上的呈现方式，甚至是定价都让我们感到惊奇。这次就让我们一起来聊聊Goldwin 0和Gorpcore风潮背后的东西……</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家留言、关注或是去看我们B站的视频版节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 序言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 产品开箱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">06:28</a> Veilance Or Goldwin 0 ?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1031">17:11</a> Goldwin 0更适用于哪些人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1234">20:34</a> Gorpcore市场已经饱和了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a> 你会穿一件8k的冲锋衣去户外吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1861">31:01</a> Arc'teryx是在割韭菜吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2519">41:59</a> 我来推荐几个户外品牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2699">44:59</a> 结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>「本期嘉宾」</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shufjan&amp;Santu&amp;Kuma</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3201243964?refer_flag=1001030103_" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3201243964?refer_flag=1001030103_"><span>shufjansteven</span></a><span>&amp;</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6156494365" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6156494365"><span>_Santu_</span></a><span>&amp;</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3282820825?topnav=1&amp;wvr=6&amp;topsug=1" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3282820825?topnav=1&amp;wvr=6&amp;topsug=1"><span>Nitamazhemezilian</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>「创作团队」</span></p><span></span><p><span>kuma&amp;shufjan</span></p><span></span><p><span>「关注&amp;联系」</span></p><span></span><p><span>bilibili：SCOOPS辛闻</span></p>]]></description>
